  - m_Id: 1095959845359616
    m_Localized: '{0}: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662784
    m_Localized: This room was locked. Who are you, and how did you get in here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662785
    m_Localized: My name is Shaya. I am a huntress from the south.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662786
    m_Localized: When I found this room, the door was open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662787
    m_Localized: But when I stepped inside, the door slammed shut and would not budge
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662788
    m_Localized: Praise the Great Cheetah, I have been here for no more than an hour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662789
    m_Localized: And who are you, then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662790
    m_Localized: My name is Darius. I have come here on an errand for the Emperor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662791
    m_Localized: And why has a huntress from the south come to the lands of the Empire?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662792
    m_Localized: I cannot reveal my purpose to you. I swore to my elders that their
      will would be kept secret.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662793
    m_Localized: I am afraid I must insist that you at least come with me. I cannot
      let you wander around here alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662794
    m_Localized: Ha. I do not need a protector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662795
    m_Localized: I am not trying to protect you. It will be easier for me to keep
      an eye on you this way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662796
    m_Localized: I have nothing to hide, and I am no enemy of yours as long as you
      stay out of my affairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1095959916662797
    m_Localized: Then there will be no problems.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1201726493642752
    m_Localized: Oh, by the way, I can feel a draft coming from the wall to my right.
      It looks like there is something there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1202824067502080
    m_Localized: Rusty Key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1202824067502081
    m_Localized: An old rusty Key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1226484304138240
    m_Localized: You used {0}. Unlocked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4087462964318208
    m_Localized: My skills are good, but not good enough for you to overlook me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4091672858546176
    m_Localized: And who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4091672908877824
    m_Localized: I am coming with you. Staying here alone would be madness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4091672908877825
    m_Localized: As you wish. Just stay out of my way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4845788773830656
    m_Localized: Necromancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5205139023810560
    m_Localized: 'Agility: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
